// The Halvex Runner under its faction's `skirmisher` against a pack of three automaton raiders under
// `raider_basic`, 100 m apart: the arena's standard measurement fight (docs/arena.md) and one of the fights in
// the determinism check (`scripts/determinism-check.sh --fight runner_vs_raiders`).
(
    seed: 1,
    sides: [
        (entries: [(design: Ship("halvex_runner"))]),
        (entries: [(design: Ship("automaton_raider"), count: 3)]),
    ],
    start_distance: 100.0,
    time_limit: 90.0,
)
